+ * @brief Read a complete QS2 record once into its private codes destination and
+ * a small cached metadata buffer. The existing validator and metadata layout
+ * are shared with the ordinary reader. It calls the metadata callback first;
+ * that callback fills both spans. Its subsequent codes read is already done.
+ * No slot may be published unless this function returns success.
